    "title": "Town of Clifton Forge Sets Agenda for July 14 Meeting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Virginian Review Staff ,\n18 hours ago CLIFTON FORGE, VA (VR) – The Council for the Town of Clifton Forge will hold their monthly meeting on Tuesday, July 14, 2026, at 7:00 p.m. in the Council Chambers of Clifton Forge Town Hall located at 547 Main Street, Clifton Forge, Virginia.\nThe post Town of Clifton Forge Sets Agenda for July 14 Meeting appeared first on The Virginian Review .",
